<title>USA: Washington Mutual ups qtly div to $0.26.</title>
<headline>Washington Mutual ups qtly div to $0.26.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $0.26		     $0.25</p>
<p> Pay	     May 15</p>
<p> Record	  April 30</p>
<p>Note: Full name of company is Washington Mutual Inc.</p>
